<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6489" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cānĕo</span></b> , ui, 2,
			v. n.
		canus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to be gray</i> or <i>hoary</i>, <i>be white</i> (<b>poet.</b> or in post-Aug.
			prose); <i>P. a.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cānens</span></b> , entis, <i>gray</i>, <i>grayish</i>, <i>hoary</i>, <i>white</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">temporibus geminis canebat sparsa senectus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 5, 416</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">Tac. G. 31</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">canens senecta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 10, 192</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">canet in igne cinis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. A.
					A. 2, 440</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">canens gelu,</span>”
				<i>white</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Tr. 5, 2, 66</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Sil. 1, 206</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pruina,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 3,
					534</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">canentia lilia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					M. 12, 411</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dum gramina canent,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 3, 325</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">2, 13</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">canuerint herbae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. F.
					3, 880</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Juv. 14, 144</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 1,
				110</span></i> (cf. <i><span class="en">id. ib. 6, 456</span></i>; and <i><span class="en">id. F. 5,
				357</span></i>); <i><span class="en">Sil. 4, 362</span></i>.</div>
